KINDS
[guard is a person
captain is a guard].

DEFINE
[a guard named henry
 a captain named mara
 a device named brass bell].

START
[henry is calm
henry has 10 health
mara is calm].

WHEN
[player attacks a guard
<then> (damage that guard by 3
<then> (change that guard to angry].

IF
[henry has 3 damage
<then> (change mara to angry].
